Error: Jet.TraitNotImplemented: `Shown` isn't `Back`
  --> Tests/UI/trait_value_passed_as_another_trait_is_e0905.jet:29:15
    |
 29 |     take_back(value)
    |               ^^^^^
 Why: A `Shown` value carries only `Shown`; the type inside it isn't known here, so no impl can make it `Back`
 Fix: Pass the value before it becomes a `Shown` value, if its type implements `Back`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.TraitNotImplemented

